>However, the Claude 4 report provides more in-depth analysis of the aerodynamic principles, with more detailed explanations of concepts like turbulent flow, boundary layer separation, and the Magnus effect. The DeepSeek report focuses on presenting the key information in a more concise format.</p>\\n            \\n            <h3>Visual Presentation</h3>\\n            <p>The Claude 4 report contains more visual elements to illustrate the concepts discussed, including diagrams of airflow patterns, historical golf ball designs, and comparative performance charts. The DeepSeek report includes fewer illustrations but maintains a clean, professional layout.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <footer>\\n            <p>\\u00a9 2025 DrPang.AI - Comparison of AI-generated reports on golf ball dimples</p>\\n        </footer>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <script>\\n        document.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function() {\\n            const btnSideBySide = document.getElementById(\'btn-side-by-side\');\\n            const btnClaude = document.getElementById(\'btn-claude\');\\n            const btnDeepseek = document.getElementById(\'btn-deepseek\');\\n            \\n            const viewSideBySide = document.getElementById(\'view-side-by-side\');\\n            const viewClaude = document.getElementById(\'view-claude\');\\n            const viewDeepseek = document.getElementById(\'view-deepseek\');\\n            \\n            btnSideBySide.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\\n                viewSideBySide.classList.remove(\'hidden\');\\n                viewClaude.classList.add(\'hidden\');\\n                viewDeepseek.classList.add(\'hidden\');\\n                \\n                btnSideBySide.classList.add(\'active\');\\n                btnClaude.classList.remove(\'active\');\\n                btnDeepseek.classList.remove(\'active\');\\n            });\\n            \\n            btnClaude.addEventListener(\'click\', function() {\\n                viewSid